:level  T12
:name   Down The Drain
:teach  the grate: what goes down it is gone
:gate   dry 3,1
:arm    on
:par    4
:traps  0
:solves 1
:solve  Rrrr
:note   The corridor is cleared by losing the can, and the can is not coming back.
:grid
#######
#@c--E#
#######
