:level  T13
:name   Laid Over
:teach  cardboard covers a hazard, and is spent doing it
:gate   erase 2,1
:arm    on
:par    6
:traps  1
:solves 1
:solve  RRrrrr
:note   The glass is still there under it; what changed is that it can be walked on.
