:level  T14
:name   Mopped Up
:teach  the sponge dries the cell it lands on, and is not spent
:gate   erase 2,1
:arm    on
:par    8
:traps  1
:solves 1
:solve  RRRRdrru
:note   The sponge is still a sponge afterwards, which is the whole of what it is for.
