:level  T15
:name   Free Wheeling
:teach  the wheelie bin rolls until something stops it
:gate   kind push
:arm    on
:par    3
:traps  0
:solves 1
:solve  Rrd
:note   One shove takes it the length of the run, and the turning is clear behind it.
:grid
#########
#@w-----#
###E#####
#########
:end

:level  T16
:name   Coupled
:teach  two rollers already touching are one thing to shove
:gate   kind push
:arm    on
:par    4
:traps  0
:solves 1
:solve  Rrrd
:note   They travel together and stay together, so one shove clears both.
:grid
