:level  T19
:name   Two Cells, One Thing
:teach  the couch: two cells, one thing, one cell a shove
:gate   kind push
:arm    on
:par    5
:traps  0
:solves 4
:solve  dRRRd
:note   Three shoves to clear one turning, because it never travels further than it is shoved.
